rd":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"48a2ab97-58d6-413b-965d-906ec70341f0","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":621035299,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"生产主管（北海劲仔）(J10663)","OrgId":2150367,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、负责鱼制品/蛋制品车间的生产管理，提高生产效率，稳定产品质量；\n2、负责鱼制品/蛋制品生产团队建设与管理，降低人员流失率，提高团队凝聚力；\n3、组织制定各工序SOP与SSOP并不断优化，降低损耗，保障车间洁净卫生；\n4、定期开展员工技能培训与质量知识培训，提升员工技能熟练度与质量意识；\n5、负责车间硬件与设备的维护、改造、升级，确保生产活动有序开展以及各工序的产品合格率；\n6、依据生产订单组织生产，审核生产计划，巡查各工序生产进度及产品质量状态，对生产的产品质量与数量负责；\n7、开展员工安全教育，不定期开展车间内安全检查，预防安全事故。","Require":"1、本科及以上学历，5年及以上生产管理经验；\n2、熟悉生产制造运作流程，擅长生产控制及现场管理，精通生产制造的各个环节；\n3、熟练掌握生产成本控制，统筹运作，熟知生产作业流程和工艺规程；\n4、熟练掌握生产质量的控制管理，熟知ISO、HACCP体系认证；\n5、具备良好的执行力、语言表达能力、组织协调能力、写作能力、团队合作能力、紧急事故处理能力。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-10-16T08:44:16","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"5ec6956b-13b5-4df3-80c3-591548c92387","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":620964249,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"稽核经理(J10565)","OrgId":1608840,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.对稽核员的工作效果进行检查，按日考核标准对稽核员进行考核；\n2.每月有针对性地对稽核员进行培训，提高稽核员的工作能力；\n3.在工作过程中发现公司规章制度不全的，督促对应部门完成相关规章制度的制定，稽核部根据相关的制度、标准对现场进行稽核；\n4.负责稽核部门的运作流程、制度、岗位职责及标准化文件的编制和适时修订；\n5.按标准要求对公司各工序安全生产管理进行监督与检查，对未按要求安全生产的管理者或违规者及时予以处理；\n6.对厂区的环保管理工作进行监督与检查。对未按要求执行的管理者予以处罚；\n7.向稽核员传达公司的政策、规章制度等；\n8.每日根据各部门反馈的重点事项、上级领导交代的任务跟进落实；\n9.协调各部门理顺工作流程和解决工作中的难点；\n10.跟进会议决议的落实和执行；\n11.完成上级领导交代的其他临时工作。","Require":"1、本科以上，5年以上经验；\n2、具备丰富的现场管理工作经验；熟悉生产工艺流程、6S管理、品质、安全等方面的知识；\n3、具备1000人以上公司工作背景，熟悉现场管理、生产流程，懂得产品品质，生产安全、计划安排等知识。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-03-26T09:43:58","JobVideoJd":"{\"Name\":\"玩转视频JD\",\"Name_en_US\":null,\"StdIsDeleted\":false,\"Description\":\"还在发一长串职位介绍给你的候选人吗？千篇一律的招聘信息怎么吸引候选人的眼睛？北森视频JD，给你一个职位宣传新方式！\",\"Description_en_US\":null,\"PermissionBy\":null,\"PermissionOrganization\":\"-1|4\",\"PermissionOrganization_SelfAndChildren\":\"-1\",\"VideoInfoJson\":\"[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"job-videoa5861214-11d4-e7b0-3b8